  "body": "We should only support logins by mxid, not by seperate user name+ server URL.\r\n\r\nThis causes confusion every time a new client tries to make a login and registration screen.\r\nWith .well-known and SRV records working very well, the user should never be expected to know the actual URL of the matrix server.",
